          <tr><td><a href={L('0016-exercise-claims-workflow')}>4.6</a></td><td><strong>Workflow</strong></td><td>Fixed steps, one LLM call to read the claim, the rest in code</td></tr>
          <tr><td><a href={L('0013-exercise-claim-agent')}>4.5</a></td><td><strong>ReAct agent</strong></td><td>The model picks the next tool each turn; errors go back to it</td></tr>
